-- mvtk/enemies/enemy.script  
-- Generic enemy script that can use the new modular AI and spawning systems.
-- Supports configurable attack patterns, health, speed, and AI behavior types.
-- Integrates with EnemyAI controller and EnemySpawner for advanced behavior.

